{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Scan area, if object visible then approach, take it, process it; otherwise move to destination and perform task. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    /> <Action ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Action ID = IsObjectInHand    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Condition ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = PerformTask    />",
    "BT": {
